  "headline": "Indonesian National Police Initiate Ethics Hearings On Wiretapping",
  "seoTitle": "Indonesian Police Conduct Ethics Hearings On Wiretapping",
  "metaDescription": "The Indonesian National Police have begun professional ethics hearings for high-ranking officers involved in a presidential wiretapping investigation.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Professional ethics hearings have commenced for Inspector General Eko Hadi Santoso regarding his involvement in the presidential wiretapping case.",
    "The Indonesian National Police have scheduled a separate ethics hearing for former police chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo for the upcoming week.",
    "Officials have deferred the ethics hearing for Inspector General Slamet Uliandi, citing reasons that currently prevent the session from proceeding."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) are conducting a series of internal disciplinary proceedings involving high-ranking officials following allegations of unauthorized wiretapping of President Prabowo Subianto. As of November 17, 2026, the Ethics Commission (KKEP) has officially begun proceedings against Inspector General Eko Hadi Santoso at the headquarters in Jakarta. Meanwhile, the police have confirmed that former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo is also slated for an ethics review, with his hearing scheduled for the following week. Conversely, the commission is currently unable to proceed with a hearing for Inspector General Slamet Uliandi, who is also identified as a suspect in the investigation. The police have not yet disclosed the specific reasons for the delay in his case, nor have they announced the presiding officials for the upcoming hearing involving the former police chief.",
